Subject: [PATCH 316/638] cef: expose OSR fling scheduler compositor

Apply CEF's upstream osr_fling_2745 patch as a discrete prerequisite for RenderWidgetHostViewOSR.

AI_PHASE: chromium-cef-bootstrap

AI_STATUS: upstream-osr-fling-prerequisite-applied

AI_ASSUMPTION: CEF 52dac911 patch stack is authoritative for Chromium 124.0.6367.0 integration

AI_VALIDATION: build 16 reported missing RenderWidgetHostImpl::SetCompositorForFlingScheduler

AI_EVIDENCE: test-artifacts/-cef-bootstrap-20260724/16-libcef-static-after-blink-devtools.log

AI_DECISION_CHAIN:; 52dac911; 3940c07c77
---
 .../browser/renderer_host/input/fling_scheduler.cc    |  3 +++
